					"content": "快看，我前几天在竞技场买了这个。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330805,
					"content": "哦，这上面是我们之前见过的涂鸦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330806,
					"content": "现在可难买了，我排了好久的队才买到，哈哈哈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330807,
					"content": "我也有件画上这个涂鸦的衣服，我挂在床头了，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330808,
						150330810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330808,
					"content": "没错，正是大名鼎鼎的我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330809
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150330809,
					"content": "下次麻烦你给我的衣服签名吧，我会珍藏起来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330812,
					"content": "对了，你们来这里，有什么安排吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330810,
					"content": "有点不好意思…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330811
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150330811,
					"content": "哈哈哈，受欢迎是件好事啊，这是你应有的待遇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
